From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: oop23 <ilidans01yt@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 03:51:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Remove every file deletion and file copy action from the UI

Delete (single, multiple, whole TV show, whole collection, folder),
copy on device and NFO export entries are gone from the phone and TV
interfaces. Delete refuses at its entry points before unindexing
anything, so the library always stays consistent with the source.
The subtitles wizard no longer renames files on the drive: it copies
the chosen subtitle into the private subtitles cache instead.
